`Button(#{ shortcut: "cmd-p" })` renders the legend `cmd-p`: `button.rhai:184` uses the prop as both label and keystrokes, and line 232 draws it as plain text. The same Button with `action` gets the platform legend from `ctx.action_shortcut` (`⌘P` on macOS), and Menu (`menu.rhai:181`) and Command (`command.rhai:212`) draw shortcuts with `Kbd` inline. Three components, three ways to show a shortcut.

